## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema100 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,100,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double sar = iSAR(NULL,PERIOD_M5,0.01,0.1,1)` (P2 default)
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_M5,64,128,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- SL: 3*pip + distance from close to PSAR, capped at 15 pips
- TP: 9 pips fixed
- P3 sweeps: PSAR (0.01,0.1) vs (0.02,0.2), MACD (64,128,9) vs (32,64,9) vs (12,26,9), TP (7/9/12 pips)

